  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free of lookahead Vary value in mod_rewrite\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-56154.patch: copy the Vary header name into\n       r->pool before destroying the LA-U/LA-F lookahead sub-request in\n       lookup_variable() in modules/mappers/mod_rewrite.c.\n     - CVE-2026-56154\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow in mod_vhost_alias interpolation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63292.patch: reject a VirtualDocumentRoot\n       segment that does not fit the HUGE_STRING_LEN buffer with HTTP 414\n       in vhost_alias_checkspace() in modules/mappers/mod_vhost_alias.c.\n     - CVE-2026-63292\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: mishandled incomplete input in mod_xml2enc\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63686.patch: handle APR_INCOMPLETE from the\n       converter and pass unconverted input raw instead of looping on a\n       NULL converter in xml2enc_ffunc() in modules/filters/mod_xml2enc.c.\n     - CVE-2026-63686",
